"true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span><span>100</span> files per request</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Anonymous deploys — no account, ever</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Drops live <span>30 days</span> — <span>90</span> with a free account</span> </li></ul></section><section aria-label="Pro features"><h3>Pro<span>$<!-- -->4<!-- --> <!-- -->/ month</span></h3><p>For drops that stick around</p><ul><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Everything in Free</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Drops never expire</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Any TTL — <span>60 s</span> to forever</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Named drops / preview channels</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span><span>100 MB</span> zip (<span>400 MB</span> decompressed)</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span><span>10,000</span> files per request</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span><span>120</span> deploys per minute</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>API keys</span> </li></ul></section><section aria-label="Team features"><h3>Team<span>$<!-- -->19<!-- --> <!-- -->/ month</span></h3><p>Your name on every preview</p><ul><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Everything in Pro</span> </li><li> <svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span>Vanity subdomain: <span>acme--*.shipped.run</span></span> </li></ul></section></div></details><p id="pricing-footnote">Prices charged via Stripe — cancel anytime in the billing portal.</p></section><section id="features" class="py-20 sm:py-24" aria-labelledby="features-title"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[75rem] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="cur-capability-heading"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-700"> <!-- -->Features<!-- --> </p><h2 id="features-title" class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-surface-950 sm:text-4xl"> <!-- -->Everything is a flag on one endpoint<!-- --> </h2><p class="max-w-[37.5rem] text-balance text-lg text-surface-600"> <!-- -->No dashboards required. Read the ten things below, then never think about hosting again.<!-- --> </p></div><div id="features-grid" class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-6"><article id="feat-api-first" class="folio-card folio-card--emphasis cur-capability-card cur-capability-api"><div class="folio-card__specimen"><div class="cur-capability-api-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 520 238" fill="none" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="_R_j6d_-payload" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#edf4ff"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#85a6e8"></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="_R_j6d_-endpoint" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#4677e0"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2348a5"></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d="M-25 204 221 60 547 131M-25 228 221 84 547 155" stroke="#3b5685" stroke-opacity=".5"></path><path d="M139 73H232Q250 73 250 91V118M155 118H336M139 166H232Q250 166 250 148V118" stroke="#7599eb" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="m325 110 11 8-11 8" stroke="#b7cdff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><g transform="translate(40 28) rotate(-7 64 30)"><rect x="-5" y="7" width="126" height="59" rx="7" fill="#294675" stroke="#6686b7"></rect><rect width="126" height="59" rx="7" fill="url(#_R_j6d_-payload)" stroke="#dbe9ff"></rect><text x="22" y="38" fill="#1b396b" font-size="23" font-family="monospace">HTML</text></g><g transform="translate(60 90)"><rect x="-5" y="7" width="126" height="59" rx="7" fill="#264887" stroke="#789adc"></rect><rect width="126" height="59" rx="7" fill="#456dc1" stroke="#a8c4ff"></rect><text x="22" y="38" fill="#f0f5ff" font-size="23" font-family="monospace">JSON</text></g><g transform="translate(40 153) rotate(7 64 30)"><rect x="-5" y="7" width="126" height="59" rx="7" fill="#294675" stroke="#6686b7"></rect><rect width="126" height="59" rx="7" fill="url(#_R_j6d_-payload)" stroke="#dbe9ff"></rect><text x="22" y="38" fill="#1b396b" font-size="23" font-family="monospace">ZIP</text></g><path d="m348 72 139-13v122l-139 13Z" fill="#142e63" stroke="#668dde"></path><rect x="337" y="61" width="139" height="122" rx="10" fill="url(#_R_j6d_-endpoint)" stroke="#91b6ff"></rect><path d="M337 101H476" stroke="#8bb2ff" stroke-opacity=".55"></path><text x="357" y="88" fill="#e2ecff" font-size="20" font-family="monospace">POST</text><text x="352" y="148" fill="#fff" font-size="25" font-family="monospace">/deploy</text><circle cx="250" cy="118" r="4" fill="#dce9ff"></circle></svg></div></div><div class="folio-card__caption"><h3 class="folio-card__title">API-first</h3><p>One endpoint, three body formats: raw HTML, JSON multi-file (binaries as base64), or a zip — with the root directory auto-stripped so<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">dist/</code> <!-- -->archives just work.</p></div><div class="folio-card__footer"><div class="cur-capability-formats"><span class="rounded-full bg-surface-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-surface-700 ring-1 ring-surface-200">text/html</span><span class="rounded-full bg-surface-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-surface-700 ring-1 ring-surface-200">application/json</span><span class="rounded-full bg-surface-100 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-surface-700 ring-1 ring-surface-200">application/zip</span></div></div></article><article id="feat-subdomain" class="folio-card cur-capability-card cur-capability-domain"><div class="folio-card__specimen"><div class="cur-capability-domain-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cur-capability-browser"><div class="cur-capability-address">your-drop.shipped.run</div><div class="cur-capability-root"><span class="cur-capability-root-symbol">/</span><div class="cur-capability-files"><span>index.html</span><span>app.js</span><span>styles.css</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="folio-card__caption"><h3 class="folio-card__title">Own subdomain per drop</h3><p>Every drop mounts at the root of its own subdomain. Absolute paths like<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">/app.js</code> <!-- -->and<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">/styles.css</code> <!-- -->just work — no base-path rewrites, ever.</p></div><div class="folio-card__footer"><div class="relative rounded-lg bg-surface-950 ring-1 ring-surface-800"><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-3 pr-12 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-surface-200"><code><span class="text-surface-400">GET</span> /app.js<!-- --> <span class="text-surface-500">→</span> <span class="text-success-100">200</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="absolute right-2 top-2 inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-800/90 text-xs text-surface-200 transition-colors hover:bg-surface-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-950" aria-label="Copy snippet"><svg data-prefix="far" data-icon="clipboard" class="svg-inline--fa fa-clipboard" role="img" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M232 96l-80 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l80 0c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24zm0 48c37.1 0 67.6-28 71.6-64L320 80c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16l0 352c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16L64 464c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16L48 96c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16l16.4 0c4 36 34.5 64 71.6 64l80 0zM291.9 32C279 12.7 257 0 232 0L152 0c-25 0-47 12.7-59.9 32L64 32C28.7 32 0 60.7 0 96L0 448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l256 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-352c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64l-28.1 0z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article></div><details class="cur-feature-details"><summary>Explore all features<svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></summary><div id="features-details-grid"><div id="feat-unguessable" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-surface-200 transition-shadow hover:ring-surface-900 focus-within:ring-surface-900 lg:col-span-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="dice" class="svg-inline--fa fa-dice" role="img" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M141.4 2.3C103-8 63.5 14.8 53.3 53.2L2.5 242.7C-7.8 281.1 15 320.6 53.4 330.9l189.5 50.8c38.4 10.3 77.9-12.5 88.2-50.9l50.8-189.5c10.3-38.4-12.5-77.9-50.9-88.2L141.4 2.3zm23 205.7a32 32 0 1 1 55.4-32 32 32 0 1 1 -55.4 32zM79.2 220.3a32 32 0 1 1 32 55.4 32 32 0 1 1 -32-55.4zm185 96.4a32 32 0 1 1 -32-55.4 32 32 0 1 1 32 55.4zm9-208.4a32 32 0 1 1 32 55.4 32 32 0 1 1 -32-55.4zm-121 14.4a32 32 0 1 1 -32-55.4 32 32 0 1 1 32 55.4zM418 192L377.4 343.2c-17.2 64-83 102-147 84.9l-38.3-10.3 0 30.2c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l192 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-192c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64L418 192z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-950"> <!-- -->Unguessable URLs<!-- --> </h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Sharing IS the access control: ~47 bits of entropy per URL.<!-- --> <!-- -->Anyone with the link can view — no login — and nobody without it<!-- --> <!-- -->will find it.<!-- --> </p></div><div id="feat-ttl" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-surface-200 transition-shadow hover:ring-surface-900 focus-within:ring-surface-900 lg:col-span-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="hourglass-half" class="svg-inline--fa fa-hourglass-half" role="img" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M32 0C14.3 0 0 14.3 0 32S14.3 64 32 64l0 11c0 42.4 16.9 83.1 46.9 113.1l67.9 67.9-67.9 67.9C48.9 353.9 32 394.6 32 437l0 11c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l320 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l0-11c0-42.4-16.9-83.1-46.9-113.1l-67.9-67.9 67.9-67.9c30-30 46.9-70.7 46.9-113.1l0-11c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32S369.7 0 352 0L32 0zM96 75l0-11 192 0 0 11c0 19-5.6 37.4-16 53L112 128c-10.3-15.6-16-34-16-53zm16 309c3.5-5.3 7.6-10.3 12.1-14.9l67.9-67.9 67.9 67.9c4.6 4.6 8.6 9.6 12.2 14.9L112 384z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-950">Custom TTL</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Choose a lifetime with<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">?ttl=</code> <!-- -->— minimum 60 seconds. Anonymous drops cap at 30 days, free accounts at 90; subscribers go<!-- --> <!-- -->unlimited.<!-- --> </p><div class="relative mt-auto rounded-lg bg-surface-950 ring-1 ring-surface-800"><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-3 pr-12 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-surface-200"><code><span class="text-surface-400">POST</span> /deploy<span class="text-brand-300">?ttl=3600</span></code></pre><button type="button" class="absolute right-2 top-2 inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-800/90 text-xs text-surface-200 transition-colors hover:bg-surface-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:rin