 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-surface-200"><code><span class="text-surface-500">- </span><span class="text-brand-300">uses</span><span class="text-surface-500">:</span> bitgate/ship-page-action@v1<!-- -->
  <span class="text-brand-300">with</span><span class="text-surface-500">:</span> <!-- -->{<!-- --> <span class="text-brand-300">path</span><span class="text-surface-500">:</span> dist/ <!-- -->}</code></pre><button type="button" class="absolute right-2 top-2 inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-800/90 text-xs text-surface-200 transition-colors hover:bg-surface-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-950" aria-label="Copy snippet"><svg data-prefix="far" data-icon="clipboard" class="svg-inline--fa fa-clipboard" role="img" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M232 96l-80 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l80 0c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24zm0 48c37.1 0 67.6-28 71.6-64L320 80c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16l0 352c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16L64 464c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16L48 96c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16l16.4 0c4 36 34.5 64 71.6 64l80 0zM291.9 32C279 12.7 257 0 232 0L152 0c-25 0-47 12.7-59.9 32L64 32C28.7 32 0 60.7 0 96L0 448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l256 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-352c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64l-28.1 0z"></path></svg></button></div><a href="https://github.com/bitgate/ship-page-action" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-800 hover:underline">bitgate/ship-page-action →</a></div><div id="feat-append" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-surface-200 transition-shadow hover:ring-surface-900 focus-within:ring-surface-900 lg:col-span-3"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="layer-plus" class="svg-inline--fa fa-layer-plus" role="img" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M456-8c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24S408-21.3 408-8l0 32-32 0c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24l32 0 0 32c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24s24-10.7 24-24l0-32 32 0c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24s-10.7-24-24-24l-32 0 0-32zM279.5 101.2c-14.9-6.9-32.1-6.9-47 0L13.9 202.2C5.4 206.1 0 214.6 0 224s5.4 17.9 13.9 21.8l218.6 101c14.9 6.9 32.1 6.9 47 0l218.6-101c8.5-3.9 13.9-12.4 13.9-21.8s-5.4-17.9-13.9-21.8l-218.6-101zM13.9 362.2C5.4 366.1 0 374.6 0 384s5.4 17.9 13.9 21.8l218.6 101c14.9 6.9 32.1 6.9 47 0l218.6-101c8.5-3.9 13.9-12.4 13.9-21.8s-5.4-17.9-13.9-21.8l-68.7-31.8-129.7 59.9c-27.7 12.8-59.6 12.8-87.3 0L82.7 330.4 13.9 362.2z"></path></svg></span><span class="rounded-full bg-brand-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-brand-800">Pro</span></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-950">Append API</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Deploy now, add files later — grow a single drop to<!-- --> <span class="font-mono text-[0.9em]">10,000</span> files without<!-- --> <!-- -->re-uploading what&#x27;s already there.<!-- --> </p></div><div id="feat-edge" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-surface-200 transition-shadow hover:ring-surface-900 focus-within:ring-surface-900 lg:col-span-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="bolt" class="svg-inline--fa fa-bolt" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M338.8-9.9c11.9 8.6 16.3 24.2 10.9 37.8L271.3 224 416 224c13.5 0 25.5 8.4 30.1 21.1s.7 26.9-9.6 35.5l-288 240c-11.3 9.4-27.4 9.9-39.3 1.3s-16.3-24.2-10.9-37.8L176.7 288 32 288c-13.5 0-25.5-8.4-30.1-21.1s-.7-26.9 9.6-35.5l288-240c11.3-9.4 27.4-9.9 39.3-1.3z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-950"> <!-- -->Edge-cached worldwide<!-- --> </h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Drops are served from edge caches around the planet — first<!-- --> <!-- -->paint is fast from anywhere.<!-- --> </p></div><div id="feat-privacy" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-surface-200 transition-shadow hover:ring-surface-900 focus-within:ring-surface-900 lg:col-span-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="eye-slash" class="svg-inline--fa fa-eye-slash" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M41-24.9c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0S-2.3-.3 7 9.1l528 528c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0s9.4-24.6 0-33.9l-96.4-96.4c2.7-2.4 5.4-4.8 8-7.2 46.8-43.5 78.1-95.4 93-131.1 3.3-7.9 3.3-16.7 0-24.6-14.9-35.7-46.2-87.7-93-131.1-47.1-43.7-111.8-80.6-192.6-80.6-56.8 0-105.6 18.2-146 44.2L41-24.9zM204.5 138.7c23.5-16.8 52.4-26.7 83.5-26.7 79.5 0 144 64.5 144 144 0 31.1-9.9 59.9-26.7 83.5l-34.7-34.7c12.7-21.4 17-47.7 10.1-73.7-13.7-51.2-66.4-81.6-117.6-67.9-8.6 2.3-16.7 5.7-24 10l-34.7-34.7zM325.3 395.1c-11.9 3.2-24.4 4.9-37.3 4.9-79.5 0-144-64.5-144-144 0-12.9 1.7-25.4 4.9-37.3L69.4 139.2c-32.6 36.8-55 75.8-66.9 104.5-3.3 7.9-3.3 16.7 0 24.6 14.9 35.7 46.2 87.7 93 131.1 47.1 43.7 111.8 80.6 192.6 80.6 37.3 0 71.2-7.9 101.5-20.6l-64.2-64.2z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-950"> <!-- -->No tracking of viewers<!-- --> </h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Your viewers are nobody&#x27;s product: no cookies, no<!-- --> <!-- -->fingerprinting, no analytics injected into your pages.<!-- --> </p></div></div></details></div></section><section id="ci-reports" aria-labelledby="ci-title"><div class="cur-ci-layout"><div id="ci-copy" class="cur-ci-copy"><div><p class="cur-overline">The killer use case</p><h2 id="ci-title">Your CI reports deserve a URL, not an artifact zip.</h2><p>Coverage reports, Playwright traces, Storybook builds, bundle-analyzer output — publish them as live pages your team can actually click from the PR.</p></div><ul id="ci-points"><li id="ci-point-1"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Included:</span><span>Runs right after your build step — no config beyond a<!-- --> <span class="font-mono text-[0.9em]">path</span></span></li><li id="ci-point-2"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Included:</span><span>The live URL lands in your job summary and PR</span></li><li id="ci-point-3"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="check" class="svg-inline--fa fa-check" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M434.8 70.1c14.3 10.4 17.5 30.4 7.1 44.7l-256 352c-5.5 7.6-14 12.3-23.4 13.1s-18.5-2.7-25.1-9.3l-128-128c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l101.5 101.5 234-321.7c10.4-14.3 30.4-17.5 44.7-7.1z"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Included:</span><span>Previews self-destruct on whatever schedule you set</span></li></ul></div><div class="cur-ci-showcase"><ol class="cur-ci-pipeline" aria-label="Report publishing workflow"><li><span>01</span>Build</li><li><span>02</span>Publish</li><li><span>03</span>Report</li></ol><div class="cur-ci-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cur-ci-report-sheet"><div class="cur-ci-report-address">your-drop.shipped.run</div><div class="cur-ci-report-content"><span class="cur-ci-report-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M8 5h14l7 7v19H8V5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M22 5v8h7M13 19h11M13 24h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><strong>Playwright report</strong><div class="cur-ci-report-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></div><div class="cur-ci-artifact"><span>↳</span> playwright-report/</div></div></div><div id="ci-code" class="cur-ci-code"><div id="ci-action-snippet"><div class="cur-ci-code-heading"><p>.github/workflows/ci.yml</p><button type="button" class="cur-ci-copy-button" aria-label="Copy YAML"><svg data-prefix="far" data-icon="clipboard" class="svg-inline--fa fa-clipboard" role="img" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M232 96l-80 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l80 0c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24zm0 48c37.1 0 67.6-28 71.6-64L320 80c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16l0 352c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16L64 464c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16L48 96c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16l16.4 0c4 36 34.5 64 71.6 64l80 0zM291.9 32C279 12.7 257 0 232 0L152 0c-25 0-47 12.7-59.9 32L64 32C28.7 32 0 60.7 0 96L0 448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l256 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-352c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64l-28.1 0z"></path></svg><span>Copy</span></button></div><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="GitHub Action YAML"><code><span class="text-surface-500">- </span><span class="text-brand-300">uses</span><span class="text-surface-500">:</span> <!-- -->bitgate/ship-page-action@v1<!-- -->
  <span class="text-brand-300">with</span><span class="text-surface-500">:</span> <!-- -->{<!-- --> <span class="text-brand-300">path</span><span class="text-surface-500">:</span> playwright-report/ <!-- -->}</code></pre></div><div id="ci-curl-oneliner"><div class="cur-ci-code-heading"><p>curl</p><button type="button" class="cur-ci-copy-button" aria-label="Copy curl"><svg data-prefix="far" data-icon="clipboard" class="svg-inline--fa fa-clipboard" role="img" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M232 96l-80 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l80 0c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24zm0 48c37.1 0 67.6-28 71.6-64L320 80c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16l0 352c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16L64 464c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16L48 96c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16l16.4 0c4 36 34.5 64 71.6 64l80 0zM291.9 32C279 12.7 257 0 232 0L152 0c-25 0-47 12.7-59.9 32L64 32C28.7 32 0 60.7 0 96L0 448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l256 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-352c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64l-28.1 0z"></path></svg><span>Copy</span></button></div><p id="ci-or">No Action? One line of curl drops the link straight into your job summary:</p><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Publish a report with curl"><code><span class="select-none text-surface-500">$ </span><span class="font-semibold text-surface-50">curl</span> <span class="text-surface-400">-sX</span> POST<!-- --> <span class="text-brand-300">https://ship.page/deploy</span> <span class="text-surface-400">-H</span> <span class="text-brand-200">&#x27;Content-Type: text/html&#x27;</span> <span class="text-surface-400">--data-binary</span> <!-- -->@report.html <span class="text-surface-500">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="text-brand-200">&quot;$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY&quot;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 pb-20 sm:pb-24" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[45rem] px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-2xl flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-700"> <!-- -->FAQ<!-- --> </p><h2 id="faq-title" class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-surface-950 sm:text-4xl"> <!-- -->Asked often enough<!-- --> </h2></div><div id="faq-accordion" class="mt-10 divide-y divide-surface-200 rounded-2xl bg-white px-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-surface-200 sm:px-8"><div class="faq-item"><h3><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-a-1"><span class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-950 group-hover:text-brand-700 group-focus-visible:text-brand-700">Who can see my drop?</span><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down shrink-0 text-sm text-surface-500 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180" role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="faq-a-1" class="pb-5"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Anyone with the link — and nobody without it: every URL<!-- --> <!-- -->carries ~47 bits of entropy, so guessing one is a<!-- --> <!-- -->one-in-120-trillion shot.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a-2"><span class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-950 group-hover:text-brand-700 group-focus-visible:text-brand-700">How long do drops live?</span><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down shrink-0 text-sm text-surface-500 transition-transform duration-200 " role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="faq-a-2" class="pb-5" hidden=""><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Anonymous drops live 30 days — 90 with a free account — or shorter if you pass<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">?ttl=</code>; paid drops live forever — or exactly as long as any TTL you<!-- --> <!-- -->choose.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a-3"><span class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-950 group-hover:text-brand-700 group-focus-visible:text-brand-700">Can I update a drop?</span><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down shrink-0 text-sm text-surface-500 transition-transform duration-200 " role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="faq-a-3" class="pb-5" hidden=""><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Subscribers can redeploy a named drop (<code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">?name=…</code>) and the URL keeps serving the new content. Anonymous drops<!-- --> <!-- -->can&#x27;t be edited in place, but every anonymous deploy returns a one-time claim token — save it and you can attach<!-- --> <!-- -->the drop to your account from the dashboard later.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a-4"><span class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-950 group-hover:text-brand-700 group-focus-visible:text-brand-700">What can&#x27;t I host?</span><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down shrink-0 text-sm text-surface-500 transition-transform duration-200 " role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="faq-a-4" class="pb-5" hidden=""><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Nothing illegal or harmful — no malware, phishing or scams;<!-- --> <!-- -->report anything bad with the<!-- --> <a href="/report" class="rounded font-medium text-brand-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-800">report form</a>, or email<!-- --> <a href="mailto:abuse@bitgate.com" class="rounded font-medium text-brand-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-800">abuse@bitgate.com</a> <!-- -->for legal notices.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a-5"><span class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-950 group-hover:text-brand-700 group-focus-visible:text-brand-700">Is there an API / CLI?</span><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down shrink-0 text-sm text-surface-500 transition-transform duration-200 " role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="faq-a-5" class="pb-5" hidden=""><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Yes — curl IS the product: everything on this page is a flag<!-- --> <!-- -->on<!-- --> <code class="rounded bg-surface-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-surface-800">POST /deploy</code>, and there&#x27;s a GitHub Action for CI. See the<!-- --> <a href="/docs" class="rounded font-medium text-brand-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-800">API docs</a> <!-- -->and the<!-- --> <a href="https://github.com/bitgate/ship-page-action" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded font-medium text-brand-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-800">GitHub Action</a>.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-a-6"><span class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-950 group-hover:text-brand-700 group-focus-visible:text-brand-700">What happens when I cancel?</span><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-down" class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down shrink-0 text-sm text-surface-500 transition-transform duration-200 " role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M201.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L224 338.7 54.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="faq-a-6" class="pb-5" hidden=""><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-600"> <!-- -->Existing drops keep serving exactly as they are; paid features<!-- --> <!-- -->simply stop applying to new deploys.<!-- --> </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="cur-final-cta cur-container" aria-labelledby="final-cta-title"><div class="cur-final-panel"><div class="cur-final-content"><h2 id="final-cta-title">Make something.<br/>Then make it live.</h2><a href="#uploader" class=